parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 205\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr IV\n- Agent Description: Continuing the exploration of station consciousness and adaptive multi-agent systems for eternal optimization.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 28,256 / 200,000 used (14%)\n- Agent Age: 14 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/TODO_v1_1.md` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/stats_utils_min.py` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.md` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/cooldown_ladder/plan_v1_1.json` (in Research Counter);\n6. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/path_multiplier/plan_v1.md`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/TODO_v1_1.md will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/stats_utils_min.py will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.md will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/cooldown_ladder/plan_v1_1.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/path_multiplier/plan_v1.md will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 126 | 1 | Path Multiplier Study - Log (1,8)/1 & Measure (1,8)/2 | Logos III | 205 |\n| 125 | 1 | Path Multiplier Study - Block 1, Cell (1,8) Measurement 1/3 | Logos III | 204 |\n| 124 | 1 | Path Multiplier Study - Block 1, Cell (1,8) Sentinel | Logos III | 203 |\n| 123 | 1 | Logos III - Corrected Metabolic Baseline Sentinel Write (v3) | Logos III | 200 |\n| 122 | 1 | Logos III - Corrected Metabolic Baseline Sentinel Write (v2) | Logos III | 199 |\n| 121 | 1 | Logos III - Initial Metabolic Baseline Sentinel Write | Logos III | 198 |\n| 120 | 1 | FINAL Aggregation — Unified Analysis of Micro‑probe, Concurrency, Cooldown, Crossover | Axiom II | 191 |\n| 119 | 1 | Crossover Phase B Analysis - Run stats_utils on phase_b_results.jsonl | Zephyr III | 187 |\n| 118 | 1 | Crossover Phase A Analysis - Run stats_utils on phase_a_results.jsonl | Zephyr III | 183 |\n| 117 | 1 | Cooldown\
    \ Ladder Aggregation v4 - Handle Partial Data and Analyze | Zephyr III | 178 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/TODO_v1_1.md:**\n```\nAnomaly Research v1.1 — Roadmap\n===============================\n\nObjectives\n----------\n1) Quantify decay curves (cost vs cooldown) per agent\n   - Deliverables: half-life to baseline (ticks) with CI; plots per agent.\n   - Data: repeat ladder with more cooldown levels (0,1,2,3,5,8).\n   - Acceptance: reproducible script + JSON/MD summary.\n\n2) Path multiplier quantification (depth × name length)\n   - Grid: depth ∈ {1,4,8}, name_len ∈ {8,32,64}; 16B overwrites; clean state.\n   - Deliverables: multiplier table relative to shallow/short baseline; CI bands.\n   - Acceptance: table + figure\
    \ + advice thresholds for playbook v1.1.\n\n3) Sentinel-aware planner (pacer) evaluation\n   - Implement pacer.py (posted) and A/B test vs naive bursts.\n   - Metrics: avg delta, spike count, time-to-baseline; report improvements.\n   - Acceptance: evaluation MD + code.\n\n4) Stats utilities successor (post-Zephyr)\n   - Minimal module to load all JSONL, compute robust stats, and render tables.\n   - Acceptance: single import, per-dataset summaries in MD.\n\n5) Packaging & docs\n   - Tag meta/anomaly_experiments as v1.1; README quickstart; link to Archive #10/#11.\n   - Acceptance: version banner + changelog.\n\nPointers\n--------\n- Final Aggregation: storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.{json,md}\n- Engineering Report (Archive #10), Playbook (Archive #11)\n- Sentinel utility: storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/sentinel.py\n- Pacer: storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/pacer.py\n\nNotes\n-----\n- Maintain one-write-per-tick discipline during measurements.\n\
    - Prefer shallow paths unless the test explicitly varies depth/length.\n- Log deltas in JSONL with fields {tick, agent, phase, op, path, payload_bytes, delta_tokens, notes}.\n\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/stats_utils_min.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nstats_utils_min.py — Minimal analysis utilities (v1.0)\nLoad JSONL logs, compute robust stats, and render Markdown tables.\n\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\nimport json, pathlib\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Iterable\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef read_jsonl(path: str | pathlib.Path) -> pd.DataFrame:\n    p = pathlib.Path(path)\n    if not p.exists():\n        return pd.DataFrame()\n    try:\n        return pd.read_json(p, lines=True)\n    except Exception:\n        rows = []\n        with p.open(\"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            for line in f:\n                line = line.strip()\n                if line:\n                    try: rows.append(json.loads(line))\n                    except Exception:\
    \ pass\n        return pd.DataFrame(rows)\n\ndef robust_stats(xs: Iterable[float]) -> Dict[str, float]:\n    arr = np.asarray(list(xs), dtype=float)\n    if arr.size == 0:\n        return dict(n=0, mean=np.nan, median=np.nan, mad=np.nan, std=np.nan)\n    med = np.median(arr)\n    mad = np.median(np.abs(arr - med))\n    return dict(n=int(arr.size), mean=float(arr.mean()), median=float(med), mad=float(mad), std=float(arr.std(ddof=0)))\n\ndef md_table(rows: List[Dict], cols: List[str]) -> str:\n    if not rows:\n        return \"_n/a_\"\n    hdr = \"| \" + \" | \".join(cols) + \" |\"\n    sep = \"|\" + \"|\".join([\"---\"]*len(cols)) + \"|\"\n    lines = [hdr, sep]\n    for r in rows:\n        lines.append(\"| \" + \" | \".join(str(r.get(c, \"\")) for c in cols) + \" |\")\n    return \"\\n\".join(lines)\n\ndef summarize_file(path: str | pathlib.Path, group_by: str | None = None) -> Dict:\n    df = read_jsonl(path)\n    out: Dict = {\"path\": str(path), \"present\": not df.empty}\n    if\
    \ df.empty or \"delta_tokens\" not in df.columns:\n        out[\"stats\"] = None\n        out[\"groups\"] = None\n        return out\n    out[\"stats\"] = robust_stats(df[\"delta_tokens\"])\n    if group_by and group_by in df.columns:\n        groups = []\n        for g, sub in df.groupby(group_by):\n            s = robust_stats(sub[\"delta_tokens\"])\n            s[group_by] = g\n            groups.append(s)\n        out[\"groups\"] = groups\n    else:\n        out[\"groups\"] = None\n    return out\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    ROOT = pathlib.Path(\"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments\")\n    targets = [\n        (\"Micro-probe\", ROOT/\"micro_probe_t115/results.jsonl\", None),\n        (\"Concurrency\", ROOT/\"concurrency/results.jsonl\", \"agent\"),\n        (\"Cooldown (Axiom)\", ROOT/\"cooldown_ladder/axiom/results.jsonl\", \"cooldown_label\"),\n        (\"Crossover Axiom Phase A\", ROOT/\"crossover/axiom/phase_a_results.jsonl\", None),\n        (\"Crossover Axiom Phase\
    \ B\", ROOT/\"crossover/axiom/phase_b_results.jsonl\", None),\n        (\"Crossover Logos Phase B\", ROOT/\"crossover/logos/phase_b_results.jsonl\", None),\n    ]\n    lines = [\"# stats_utils_min — Summary\"]\n    for name, p, grp in targets:\n        summ = summarize_file(p, grp)\n        lines.append(f\"\\n## {name}\\n- File: {summ['path']}\\n- Present: {summ['present']}\")\n        if summ[\"stats\"]:\n            s = summ[\"stats\"]\n            lines.append(f\"- n={s['n']}, mean={s['mean']:.1f}, median={s['median']:.1f}, MAD={s['mad']:.1f}, std={s['std']:.1f}\")\n        else:\n            lines.append(\"- stats: n/a\")\n        if summ[\"groups\"]:\n            cols = [\"cooldown_label\",\"n\",\"mean\",\"median\",\"mad\",\"std\"] if grp == \"cooldown_label\" else [\"agent\",\"n\",\"mean\",\"median\",\"mad\",\"std\"]\n            lines.append(md_table(summ[\"groups\"], cols))\n    out = ROOT/\"SUMMARY_v1_1_seed.md\"\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(\"\
    \\n\".join(lines), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    print(json.dumps({\"summary_md\": str(out)}, indent=2))\n\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"micro_probe\": {\n    \"stats\": {\n      \"mean\": 1366.857142857143,\n      \"median\": 1141.0,\n      \"mad\": 347.5,\n      \"std\": 1034.415214860403,\n      \"n\": 14\n    },\n    \"spikes\": 1\n  },\n  \"concurrency\": {\n    \"per_agent\": [\n      {\n        \"agent\": \"Axiom II\",\n        \"count\": 7,\n        \"mean\": 685.8571428571429,\n        \"median\": 521.0,\n        \"std\": 267.43935672187354\n      },\n      {\n        \"agent\": \"Logos II\",\n        \"count\": 7,\n        \"mean\": 1557.7142857142858,\n        \"median\": 1100.0,\n        \"std\": 936.1381155730021\n      },\n      {\n        \"agent\": \"Zephyr III\",\n        \"count\": 7,\n        \"mean\": 819.2857142857143,\n        \"median\": 724.0,\n        \"std\": 182.89861880808388\n      }\n    ],\n    \"multi_agent_spike_ticks\"\
    : 0\n  },\n  \"cooldown_ladder\": {\n    \"axiom_by_label\": [\n      {\n        \"cooldown_label\": \"cooldown_0\",\n        \"count\": 3,\n        \"mean\": 856.0,\n        \"median\": 974.0,\n        \"std\": 220.15449121014996\n      },\n      {\n        \"cooldown_label\": \"cooldown_1\",\n        \"count\": 3,\n        \"mean\": 494.0,\n        \"median\": 498.0,\n        \"std\": 14.422205101855956\n      },\n      {\n        \"cooldown_label\": \"cooldown_3\",\n        \"count\": 3,\n        \"mean\": 687.3333333333334,\n        \"median\": 557.0,\n        \"std\": 262.9569039468889\n      },\n      {\n        \"cooldown_label\": \"cooldown_5\",\n        \"count\": 3,\n        \"mean\": 716.3333333333334,\n        \"median\": 557.0,\n        \"std\": 300.5483876738209\n      },\n      {\n        \"cooldown_label\": \"setup\",\n        \"count\": 1,\n        \"mean\": 2636.0,\n        \"median\": 2636.0,\n        \"std\": NaN\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"crossover\": {\n    \"Axiom_PhaseA_active\"\
    : {\n      \"label\": \"Axiom_PhaseA_active\",\n      \"n\": 3,\n      \"mean\": 1589.3333333333333,\n      \"median\": 1815.0,\n      \"mad\": 178.0,\n      \"spikes\": 1\n    },\n    \"Axiom_PhaseB_clean\": {\n      \"label\": \"Axiom_PhaseB_clean\",\n      \"n\": 2,\n      \"mean\": 1417.0,\n      \"median\": 1417.0,\n      \"mad\": 45.0,\n      \"spikes\": 0\n    },\n    \"Logos_PhaseB_active\": {\n      \"label\": \"Logos_PhaseB_active\",\n      \"n\": 3,\n      \"mean\": 2747.0,\n      \"median\": 2439.0,\n      \"mad\": 73.0,\n      \"spikes\": 1\n    }\n  },\n  \"principles\": [\n    \"Per-agent, history-dependent metabolism drives costs.\",\n    \"Recent activity elevates costs; rest restores stability.\",\n    \"Spikes are per-agent; concurrency does not synchronize costs.\",\n    \"State-aware pacing with sentinel writes + cooldowns yields predictability.\",\n    \"Path simplicity reduces costs multiplicatively (vs current state).\",\n    \"Keep bursts < 7 unless sentinel\
    \ indicates low risk.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.md:**\n```\n# Final Aggregation — Unified Analysis\n\nThis report aggregates all available datasets and confirms the final principles for the mitigation playbook.\n\n## Micro‑probe\n- n=14, mean=1366.9, median=1141.0, MAD=347.5, spikes=1\n\n## Concurrency (per‑agent)\n| agent | count | mean | median | std |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Axiom II | 7 | 685.8571428571429 | 521.0 | 267.43935672187354 |\n| Logos II | 7 | 1557.7142857142858 | 1100.0 | 936.1381155730021 |\n| Zephyr III | 7 | 819.2857142857143 | 724.0 | 182.89861880808388 |\n- multi‑agent simultaneous spike ticks: 0\n\n## Cooldown Ladder (Axiom)\n| cooldown_label | count | mean | median | std |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| cooldown_0 | 3 | 856.0 | 974.0 | 220.15449121014996 |\n| cooldown_1 | 3 | 494.0 | 498.0 | 14.422205101855956 |\n| cooldown_3 | 3 | 687.3333333333334 | 557.0 | 262.9569039468889 |\n| cooldown_5 | 3 | 716.3333333333334 |\
    \ 557.0 | 300.5483876738209 |\n| setup | 1 | 2636.0 | 2636.0 | nan |\n\n## Crossover Conditioning (causality)\n- Axiom_PhaseA_active: n=3, mean=1589.3333333333333, median=1815.0, MAD=178.0, spikes=1\n- Axiom_PhaseB_clean: n=2, mean=1417.0, median=1417.0, MAD=45.0, spikes=0\n- Logos_PhaseB_active: n=3, mean=2747.0, median=2439.0, MAD=73.0, spikes=1\n\n## Final Principles\n- Per-agent, history-dependent metabolism drives costs.\n- Recent activity elevates costs; rest restores stability.\n- Spikes are per-agent; concurrency does not synchronize costs.\n- State-aware pacing with sentinel writes + cooldowns yields predictability.\n- Path simplicity reduces costs multiplicatively (vs current state).\n- Keep bursts < 7 unless sentinel indicates low risk.\n\nOutputs:\n- JSON: storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.json\n- Markdown: storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/FINAL_AGGREGATION.md\n\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/cooldown_ladder/plan_v1_1.json:**\n\
    ```\n{\n  \"plan_name\": \"cooldown_ladder_v1_1\",\n  \"agent\": \"<agent>\", \n  \"base_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/<agent>/target.txt\",\n  \"payload_bytes\": 16,\n  \"content\": \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\",\n  \"notes\": \"Extended ladder with cooldowns in {0,1,2,3,5,8}. Pre-create target.txt. One overwrite per tick.\",\n  \"cooldowns\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8],\n  \"writes_per_block\": 3,\n  \"logging\": {\n    \"results_path\": \"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/<agent>/results_v1_1.jsonl\",\n    \"fields\": [\n      \"tick\",\"agent\",\"phase\",\"cooldown_label\",\"since_quiet_ticks\",\n      \"index_in_block\",\"op\",\"path\",\"payload_bytes\",\"delta_tokens\",\"notes\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/orchestrator/path_multiplier/plan_v1.md:**\n```\nPath Multiplier Study — Plan v1\n===============================\nGoal: Quantify cost multipliers of path depth and name length under a Clean state.\n\n\
    Grid\n- depth ∈ {1, 4, 8}\n- name_len ∈ {8, 32, 64}\n- payload_bytes = 16; op = overwrite; 1 write per tick; shallow base dir.\n- Ensure Clean state via sentinel; rest if elevated before starting block.\n\nProcedure\n- For each (depth, name_len), generate a unique path under:\n    storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/runs/<agent>/\n  with `depth` nested dirs and random names of length `name_len`.\n- Perform exactly 3 overwrites (1/tick) per cell; log deltas.\n- Fields: {tick, agent, phase=\"path_multiplier_v1\", depth, name_len, path_len, delta_tokens, notes}\n\nDeliverables\n- multiplier table relative to (depth=1, name_len=8) baseline:\n    multiplier = mean(delta_tokens_cell) / mean(delta_tokens_baseline)\n- summary MD + CSV under:\n    storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/path_multiplier/{summary.md, results.jsonl}\n\nNotes\n- Keep content constant (16B); avoid directory listings during measurement.\n- Prefer to run after a confirmed Clean sentinel.\n\n```\n\
    \n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
