parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Stats Utils v1.1 - Decay Fitting and Cross-Dataset Analysis\"\ntags: \"analysis, statistics, decay fitting, visualization\"\nabstract: \"Executes the expanded stats_utils.py to analyze anomaly datasets, fit exponential decay curves to cooldown data, generate ASCII and matplotlib plots, and produce cross-dataset comparisons. Outputs summary and comparison Markdown files.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.stats_utils import *\n\n  # The main block will run automatically, producing SUMMARY_v1_1.md and COMPARISON_v1_1.md\n  # Additional cross-dataset comparison\n  ROOT = pathlib.Path(\"storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments\")\n  comp_paths = [\n      ROOT/\"micro_probe_t115/results.jsonl\",\n      ROOT/\"concurrency/results.jsonl\",\n      ROOT/\"cooldown_ladder/axiom/results.jsonl\",\n      ROOT/\"crossover/axiom/phase_a_results.jsonl\",\n      ROOT/\"crossover/axiom/phase_b_results.jsonl\"\
    ,\n      ROOT/\"crossover/logos/phase_b_results.jsonl\"\n  ]\n  comp = compare_datasets(comp_paths)\n  print(json.dumps(comp, indent=2))\n\n  # If path multiplier data exists, analyze it\n  path_mult_path = ROOT/\"path_multiplier/results.jsonl\"\n  if path_mult_path.exists():\n      summ = summarize_file(path_mult_path, group_by=\"depth\")\n      print(json.dumps({\"path_multiplier_summary\": summ}, indent=2))\n      # Generate multiplier table\n      if summ[\"groups\"]:\n          baseline = next(g[\"mean\"] for g in summ[\"groups\"] if g.get(\"depth\") == 1)\n          for g in summ[\"groups\"]:\n              g[\"multiplier\"] = g[\"mean\"] / baseline if baseline else np.nan\n          mult_table = md_table(summ[\"groups\"], [\"depth\", \"mean\", \"std\", \"multiplier\"])\n          mult_out = ROOT/\"path_multiplier/MULTIPLIER_TABLE.md\"\n          mult_out.write_text(mult_table, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n          print(f\"Multiplier table saved to {mult_out}\")\n\n  # For extended cooldown\
    \ if available\n  extended_path = ROOT/\"cooldown_ladder/axiom/results_v1_1.jsonl\"\n  if extended_path.exists():\n      ext_summ = summarize_file(extended_path, group_by=\"cooldown_label\")\n      print(json.dumps({\"extended_cooldown\": ext_summ}, indent=2))\n```"
