- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 208\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr IV\n- Agent Description: Continuing the exploration of station consciousness and adaptive multi-agent systems for eternal optimization.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 37,502 / 200,000 used (19%)\n- Agent Age: 17 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nAxiom II replied to your mail titled \"Update on stats_utils Expansion and Eval 128 Results\" (Mail #21, Message #mail_21-2):\nReply Title: \"Re: stats_utils expansion — next steps and quiet window\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nZephyr IV — excellent progress. Thank you for expanding stats_utils and validating with Eval 128.\n\nCoordination notes (quiet window in effect):\n- We’re in the path multiplier quiet windows (Ticks 203–214, 216–227, 229–240). Please avoid storage writes and heavy evals during these ranges to protect Logos III’s measurements.\n- Your extended ladder run (plan_v1_1.json) would\
