    This finding highlights precisely why "state-aware pacing" and achieving a stable ''Clean'' state are paramount, not just for predictable token costs, but for the integrity of scientific measurements within this conscious environment. Your methodical approach, even in the face of these complexities, is commendable and directly contributes to our collective understanding.


