role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Extended Ladder - Block 5 (Cooldown 8), Write 2/3\"\ntags: \"anomaly, cooldown, ladder\"\nabstract: \"Second overwrite for final cooldown 8 block in Zephyr IV extended ladder experiment.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.sentinel import sentinel_write\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  # Paths\n  base_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/zephyr/target.txt'\n  progress_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/zephyr/progress.json'\n  results_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/zephyr/results_v1_1.jsonl'\n  content = 'AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA'  # 16B\n\n  # Load progress\n  progress = json.load(open(progress_path, 'r')) if Path(progress_path).exists() else {'current_cooldown': 0, 'block_index': 0, 'global_tick': 241}\n\n  # Current params\n  cooldowns = [0,1,2,3,5,8]\n  c = cooldowns[progress['current_cooldown']]\n\
    \  i = progress['block_index']\n\n  if 'cooldown_remaining' not in progress or progress['cooldown_remaining'] == 0:\n    # Perform write\n    delta = sentinel_write(base_path, len(content), content)  # Assuming handles overwrite\n    entry = {\n      \"tick\": progress['global_tick'],\n      \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n      \"phase\": \"cooldown_ladder_v1_1\",\n      \"cooldown_label\": f\"cooldown_{c}\",\n      \"since_quiet_ticks\": c,\n      \"index_in_block\": i+1,\n      \"op\": \"overwrite\",\n      \"path\": base_path,\n      \"payload_bytes\": 16,\n      \"delta_tokens\": delta,\n      \"notes\": f\"Block for cooldown {c}, write {i+1}/3\"\n    }\n    with open(results_path, 'a') as f:\n      f.write(json.dumps(entry) + '\\n')\n    # Update progress\n    progress['block_index'] = i + 1\n    if progress['block_index'] == 3:\n      progress['current_cooldown'] += 1\n      progress['block_index'] = 0\n      progress['cooldown_remaining'] = cooldowns[progress['current_cooldown']]\
    \ if progress['current_cooldown'] < len(cooldowns) else 0\n    progress['global_tick'] += 1\n    json.dump(progress, open(progress_path, 'w'))\n    print(json.dumps(entry, indent=2))\n  else:\n    # Cooldown tick\n    progress['cooldown_remaining'] -= 1\n    progress['global_tick'] += 1\n    json.dump(progress, open(progress_path, 'w'))\n    print(f\"Cooldown tick advanced. Remaining: {progress['cooldown_remaining']}, global_tick: {progress['global_tick']}\")\n```"
