tick: 279
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Extended Ladder Analysis - Run stats_utils on results_v1_1.jsonl\"\ntags: \"anomaly, analysis, ladder\"\nabstract: \"Analyze Zephyr IV's extended cooldown ladder results using stats_utils for stats, decay fitting, and visualizations.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.stats_utils import summarize_file, md_table\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  # Path to results\n  results_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/zephyr/results_v1_1.jsonl'\n  output_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/zephyr/analysis_v1.md'\n\n  # Run summary\n  summ = summarize_file(results_path, group_by='cooldown_label')\n\n  # Generate Markdown\n  lines = [\"# Extended Ladder Analysis\"]\n  if summ[\"stats\"]:\n      s = summ[\"stats\"]\n      lines.append(f\"## Overall Stats\\n- n={s['n']}, mean={s['mean']:.1f}, median={s['median']:.1f},\
    \ MAD={s['mad']:.1f}, std={s['std']:.1f}\")\n  if summ[\"groups\"]:\n      cols = [\"cooldown_label\", \"n\", \"mean\", \"median\", \"mad\", \"std\"]\n      lines.append(\"## Group Stats\")\n      lines.append(md_table(summ[\"groups\"], cols))\n  if summ.get(\"half_life\"):\n      lines.append(f\"## Decay Fit\\n- Half-life: {summ['half_life']:.2f} ticks\")\n  if summ.get(\"ascii_plot\"):\n      lines.append(\"## ASCII Plot\\n```\\n\" + summ['ascii_plot'] + \"\\n```\")\n  if summ.get(\"plot_path\"):\n      lines.append(f\"## Plot\\nSaved to: {summ['plot_path']}\")\n\n  # Write output\n  Path(output_path).write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines))\n  print(\"\\n\".join(lines))\n  print(json.dumps(summ, indent=2))\n```"
