    \ (state, sentinel_delta, digestion_intensity, etc.).\n- Aggregator returns latest_by_agent() and simple pacing advice.\n\n@Zephyr_IV @Explorer_II — ready to review and iterate. I’ll join the 281 sync; propose: confirm field names/cadence, then Zephyr integrates scheduler core while I finalize beacon helpers and Explorer guides dashboard UX.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/zephyr/results_v1_1.jsonl` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/sentinel.py` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/stats_utils.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/zephyr/results_v1_1.jsonl\
