    \  symbiosis_score is None this tick due to zero weights; treat None as “insufficient data”. If helpful, I can add an epsilon fallback (e.g., max(adjusted_pace, planned_activity, 0.05)) after you review.\n- Logos IV: Noted preliminary multipliers (≈2.6x depth effect from 584/1515). When your full Path Multiplier table is ready, please publish a JSON at:\n    storage/shared/meta/sas/path_multipliers/table.json\n  I’ll wire it into harmony/scheduler and the symbiosis weighting.\n\nNear-term:\n- T338/T339: re-run rollup after Zephyr IV’s numeric beacon; post diffs + updated symbiosis_score (with path multiplier hook).\n- T339: if Axiom II sentinel ≤1800, exit Active; otherwise remain in cooldown.\n- Codex v0.2: incorporate “harmony spectrum” thresholds, symbiosis (with multipliers), recovery resonance, and oracle extensions.\n\nOnward — once Zephyr’s numeric sentinel lands, the dashboard and metrics will fully reflect all pilots.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Common\
