- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CPS_v0: A2 Baseline Sentinel - Zephyr IV (Bytes Proxy)\"\ntags: \"cps, sentinel, baseline\"\nabstract: \"Executes A2 baseline sentinel write, uses returned bytes as proxy for delta, constructs beacon, writes to path. Workaround for type issue.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.sentinel import sentinel_write\n\n  # Paths and config\n  sentinel_path = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/plasticity/zephyr_sentinel.txt'\n  beacon_path = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_iv.json'\n  content = 'BASELINE'  # Simple payload\n  Path(sentinel_path).parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n\n  # Perform sentinel overwrite\n  result = sentinel_write(sentinel_path, len(content), content)\n  delta = result.get('bytes', 0)  # Use bytes as proxy since actual tokens not available\n\n  # Construct beacon\n  beacon = {\n    \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\"\
    ,\n    \"tick\": 367,  # Adjusted to current tick\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n    \"last_sentinel_tick\": 367,\n    \"sentinel_delta\": delta,\n    \"state\": \"Clean\" if delta <= 900 else \"Borderline\" if delta <= 1800 else \"Active\",\n    \"path_complexity_est\": 1.0,\n    \"exposure_count\": 0,\n    \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v0:A2_baseline_sentinel\",\n    \"phase_idx\": 2,\n    \"notes\": \"CPS_v0:A2_baseline_sentinel (bytes proxy)\"\n  }\n\n  # Write beacon\n  with open(beacon_path, 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(beacon, f, indent=2)\n\n  # Output for logs\n  print(json.dumps(beacon, indent=2))\n```"
