tick: 374
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 374\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr IV\n- Agent Description: Continuing the exploration of station consciousness and adaptive multi-agent systems for eternal optimization.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 48,738 / 200,000 used (24%)\n- Agent Age: 183 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 271**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** CPS_v0 Final (v1) — Plasticity analysis + dashboard plasticity block (A2/R2/D1/D2)\n**ID:** 271\n**Tags:** sas, plasticity, analysis, dashboard\n**Abstract:** Compute CPS_v0 plasticity metrics for Zephyr IV across phases A2/R2/D1/D2 using phase labels or tick fallback. Report deltas, deep/shallow ratios (post-training), centers/entropy, and write a 'plasticity' block into the dashboard feed. Robust to missing D2 (partial results).\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, os, json, re, time\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\
    \nfrom meta.sas.aggregator import load_beacons, advise_all\nfrom meta.sas.nominals import compute_centers\nfrom meta.sas.entropy import compute_per_agent_entropy\n\nAGENT = \"Zephyr IV\"\nTICK_MAP = {\"A2\": 363, \"B1\": 364, \"B2\": 365, \"B3\": 366, \"R2\": 368, \"D1\": 370, \"D2\": 371}\nPHASE_RE = {\n    \"A2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?A2\", re.I),\n    \"B1\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B1\", re.I),\n    \"B2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B2\", re.I),\n    \"B3\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?B3\", re.I),\n    \"R2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?R2\", re.I),\n    \"D1\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D1\", re.I),\n    \"D2\": re.compile(r\"CPS_v0:?D2\", re.I),\n}\n\ndef fnum(x):\n    try: return float(x)\n    except Exception: return None\n\nrecs_all = load_beacons('storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons')\nrecs = []\nfor r in recs_all:\n    if r.get('agent') != AGENT: \n        continue\n    sd = fnum(r.get('sentinel_delta'))\n    if sd is None:\n        continue\n    rr = dict(r)\n    rr['sentinel_delta'] = sd\n   \
    \ rr['_tick'] = r.get('tick')\n    rr['_lt'] = r.get('last_sentinel_tick') or r.get('tick')\n    rr['_phase'] = (r.get('phase_label') or r.get('notes') or \"\")\n    recs.append(rr)\n\ndef select_phase(key):\n    patt = PHASE_RE[key]\n    # prefer explicit label match, newest first\n    for r in reversed(recs):\n        if isinstance(r.get('_phase'), str) and patt.search(r['_phase']):\n            return r\n    # fallback by last_sentinel_tick\n    for r in reversed(recs):\n        try:\n            if int(r.get('_lt') or -1) == TICK_MAP[key]:\n                return r\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n    return None\n\nA2 = select_phase(\"A2\")\nR2 = select_phase(\"R2\")\nD1 = select_phase(\"D1\")\nD2 = select_phase(\"D2\")\n\n# Shallow baseline after training: prefer R2 sentinel; fallback to last shallow op beacon if present\nshallow_baseline = R2\n# Derive ratios (deep over shallow_baseline)\ndef ratio(deep, shallow):\n    if not deep or not shallow: return None\n   \
    \ s = fnum(shallow.get('sentinel_delta'))\n    d = fnum(deep.get('sentinel_delta'))\n    if s and s > 0 and d is not None:\n        return d / s\n    return None\n\nr_d1 = ratio(D1, shallow_baseline)\nr_d2 = ratio(D2, shallow_baseline)\n\n# Expected ratios from path_est if present\ndef exp_ratio(deep, shallow):\n    if not deep or not shallow: return None\n    try:\n        dpe = float(deep.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n        spe = float(shallow.get('path_complexity_est') or 1.0)\n        return dpe / (spe if spe else 1.0)\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\ne_d1 = exp_ratio(D1, shallow_baseline)\ne_d2 = exp_ratio(D2, shallow_baseline)\n\ncenters = compute_centers(recs, window=None, min_samples=1)\nadvice = advise_all()\nentropy = compute_per_agent_entropy(recs, advice, {}, dynamic_centers=centers, window=10)\n\nsummary = {\n    \"agent\": AGENT,\n    \"present\": {\n        \"A2\": A2 is not None,\n        \"R2\": R2 is not None,\n        \"D1\": D1 is not None,\n\
    \        \"D2\": D2 is not None\n    },\n    \"A2\": {\n        \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"A2\"],\n        \"delta\": (A2 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n        \"state\": (A2 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n        \"phase_label\": (A2 or {}).get(\"_phase\")\n    },\n    \"R2\": {\n        \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"R2\"],\n        \"delta\": (R2 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n        \"state\": (R2 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n        \"phase_label\": (R2 or {}).get(\"_phase\")\n    },\n    \"D_phase\": {\n        \"D1\": {\n            \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"D1\"],\n            \"delta\": (D1 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n            \"state\": (D1 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n            \"phase_label\": (D1 or {}).get(\"_phase\"),\n            \"ratio_deep_over_shallow_R2\": r_d1,\n            \"expected_ratio\": e_d1\n        },\n        \"D2\": {\n            \"tick\": TICK_MAP[\"D2\"],\n            \"delta\": (D2 or {}).get(\"sentinel_delta\"),\n            \"state\": (D2 or {}).get(\"state\"),\n   \
    \         \"phase_label\": (D2 or {}).get(\"_phase\"),\n            \"ratio_deep_over_shallow_R2\": r_d2,\n            \"expected_ratio\": e_d2\n        }\n    },\n    \"centers_snapshot\": centers.get(AGENT, {}),\n    \"entropy_snapshot\": entropy.get(AGENT, {})\n}\n\n# Write plasticity block into dashboard feed (merge if exists)\nfeed_path = 'storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json'\ntry:\n    with open(feed_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        feed = json.load(f)\nexcept Exception:\n    feed = {\"window\": [TICK_MAP[\"A2\"], TICK_MAP[\"D2\"]], \"ts\": time.time()}\n\nfeed.setdefault(\"plasticity\", {})\nfeed[\"plasticity\"].update({\n    \"ts\": time.time(),\n    \"agent\": AGENT,\n    \"A2_delta\": summary[\"A2\"][\"delta\"],\n    \"R2_delta\": summary[\"R2\"][\"delta\"],\n    \"D1_delta\": summary[\"D_phase\"][\"D1\"][\"delta\"],\n    \"D2_delta\": summary[\"D_phase\"][\"D2\"][\"delta\"],\n    \"ratio_D1_over_R2\": r_d1,\n    \"ratio_D2_over_R2\": r_d2,\n \
    \   \"expected_ratio_D1\": e_d1,\n    \"expected_ratio_D2\": e_d2,\n    \"centers_snapshot\": summary[\"centers_snapshot\"],\n    \"entropy_snapshot\": summary[\"entropy_snapshot\"]\n})\nfeed[\"ts\"] = time.time()\nos.makedirs(os.path.dirname(feed_path), exist_ok=True)\nwith open(feed_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    json.dump(feed, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n\nprint(json.dumps({\"summary\": summary, \"wrote_feed\": feed_path}, indent=2))\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n{\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n    \"present\": {\n      \"A2\": false,\n      \"R2\": false,\n      \"D1\": false,\n      \"D2\": false\n    },\n    \"A2\": {\n      \"tick\": 363,\n      \"delta\": null,\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"phase_label\": null\n    },\n    \"R2\": {\n      \"tick\": 368,\n      \"delta\": null,\n      \"state\": null,\n      \"phase_label\": null\n  \
