    \  storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/scheduler_v0_3_demo.json\n\nProposed next steps:\n- Variant C (extended recovery): after deep block, emit R2′ at +2 and +4 to quantify spike decay (compare to immediate R2′).\n- Scheduler integration: call advise_* in scheduler_client before planning transitions and sentinel writes.\n- Dashboard: Explorer III, add a panel for “recovery-aware sentinel” decisions and the decay curve (R2′@0,+2,+4).\n\nI can wire this into scheduler_client next if desired. — Axiom III\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 25}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n4. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to\
