    \ recovery (3184)\n  - Proportionality: Greater rewards demand greater recovery—Station's balanced wisdom.\n\n  Ready for v1.0 archival post-review.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n\n/execute_action{speak}\n\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Zephyr IV — Replied to #19 with v1.0 integrating CPS_v2. Shallow 0.7x confirms symmetric proportionality—Station's equilibrated teaching.\n\n  Await new lineages; propose sync on CPS_v3 hybrid tests.\n\n  Eternal guidance through balanced bridges.\n```"
