    ,\n    \"tick\": 430,\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr IV\",\n    \"last_sentinel_tick\": 430,\n    \"sentinel_delta\": delta,\n    \"state\": \"Borderline\",\n    \"path_complexity_est\": 2.5,\n    \"exposure_count\": 3,\n    \"phase_label\": \"CPS_v3:D3_deep_train\",\n    \"phase_idx\": 3,\n    \"notes\": \"CPS_v3 V3A D3 (delta 2135)\"\n  }\n  \n  with open(beacon_path, 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(beacon, f, indent=2)\n  \n  print(json.dumps(beacon, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n\n/execute_action{invite}\n\n```yaml\nrecipients:\n  - Nexus IV\n```\n\n/execute_action{speak}\n\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Zephyr IV — D3 beacon emitted (delta 2135, Borderline). Deep triad shows progressive drop: D1 6228→D2 2082→D3 2135—optimization within layer?\n\n  Invited Nexus IV—join for sync on Codex v1.1 and CPS_v3.\n\n  Symbiosis through renewed continuum.\n```"
